{"title":"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 27","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Rigorous_Proof)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Rigorous Proof)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Hit_and_Trial)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Hit and Trial)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Consider a sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa28e5eccd2eb379274f40f982ae90ac5f7fa809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1,x_2,x_3,\\dotsc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" /> defined by:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/5/ed51c2019aa1b7eeb8ca1aebea158c707113bf1d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}&amp;x_1 = \\sqrt[3]{3}, \\\\ &amp;x_2 = \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\sqrt[3]{3}},\\end{align*}\" width=\"115\" height=\"68\" />\nand in general\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/a/59a772cd4c0401874f7fa0d0ccabae36e2d68b78.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_n = \\left(x_{n-1}\\right)^{\\sqrt[3]{3}} \\text{ for } n &gt; 1.\\]\" width=\"195\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>What is the smallest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195db3e04ee69d85a0aeaedbb1cf9afa97ff4546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/e/3/ae3c03e1b3e28a7e67a898a7967d7ce7d1a4c2ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ } 2 \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ }3 \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\  } 4 \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\  } 9 \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\  }27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"353\" height=\"20\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Rigorous_Proof.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Rigorous_Proof)\">Solution 1 (Rigorous Proof)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Rigorous Proof)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Firstly, we will show by induction that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/0/fe006ce0e854fad53a9fb5a8b63f9dc132c01091.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_n = \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{n-1}\\right)}.\\]\" width=\"169\" height=\"41\" /> For the base case, we indeed have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/1/ad14827c6054c70a499b6fc9ee0f3e44dea47af1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x_1 &amp;= \\sqrt[3]{3} \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^1 \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^0\\right)},\\end{align*}\" width=\"151\" height=\"113\" /> and for the inductive step, if our claim is true for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195db3e04ee69d85a0aeaedbb1cf9afa97ff4546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/9/f096001a8b35111135baad7d384593b50eb4711c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x_{n+1} &amp;= \\left(x_n\\right)^{\\sqrt[3]{3}} \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{n-1}\\right)}\\right)^{\\sqrt[3]{3}} \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{n-1}\\cdot\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^n\\right)},\\end{align*}\" width=\"227\" height=\"188\" /> which completes the proof.\n</p><p>We now rewrite our formula for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195db3e04ee69d85a0aeaedbb1cf9afa97ff4546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> as follows:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/8/4a8e04d8f3e268a055bc66753110d434e394e1d9.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*}x_n &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(\\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{n-1}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= \\left(\\sqrt[3]{3}\\right)^{\\left(3^{\\frac{n-1}{3}}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;=3^{\\left(\\frac{1}{3} \\cdot 3^{\\frac{n-1}{3}}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= 3^{\\left(3^{\\left(\\frac{n-1}{3}-1\\right)}\\right)} \\\\ &amp;= 3^{\\left(3^{\\left(\\frac{n-4}{3}\\right)}\\right)},\\end{align*}\" width=\"159\" height=\"219\" />\nand as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not a perfect power, we deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/5/195db3e04ee69d85a0aeaedbb1cf9afa97ff4546.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is an integer if and only if the exponent, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/7/bd74658c47be735a212908a4f13b9d81890d57e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^{\\left(\\frac{n-4}{3}\\right)}$\" width=\"47\" height=\"20\" />, is itself an integer. By precisely the same argument, this reduces to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/2/8/32883f99b16b34e5898656cd279fd9c3068df624.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{n-4}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"44\" height=\"37\" /> being an integer, so the smallest possible (positive) value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c15d2c31bdc64e3af356e8576d80310ab0fbe100.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Hit_and_Trial.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Hit_and_Trial)\">Solution 2 (Hit and Trial)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Hit and Trial)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Observe that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/1/b71d297cefcea535a1a36e0d9a3ec443bae87354.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2 = \\sqrt[3]{3}^{\\sqrt[3]{3}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"29\" /> is not an integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/6/9/f69760d4d46043898c0da10b5c2bb6b47e839552.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3 = \\sqrt[3]{3}^{\\sqrt[3]{9}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"89\" height=\"29\" /> is also not an integer. However, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/1/d918f9f8d336b5c470dc75347bc3729d73216f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4 = \\sqrt[3]{3}^{\\sqrt[3]{27}} = \\sqrt[3]{3}^3 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"185\" height=\"29\" /> is an integer. Hence at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/1/5218af40079081e694d8b82eeac2d368ef6ea76a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" /> we hit an integer for the first time, and thus our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/5/c15d2c31bdc64e3af356e8576d80310ab0fbe100.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(C)} \\ 4}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"53\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME\" title=\"1985 AHSME\">1985 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1985 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1985\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">Problem 26</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">Problem 28</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1985_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1985 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017174850\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.037 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 186/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5233/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.778      1 -total\n 56.72%    7.248      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 40.62%    5.190      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:10404:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017174850 and revision id 284031. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}